.dev-logs/
# Rust build outputs. The native stack is one cargo workspace under desktop/,
# so **/target/ now covers a single desktop/target/ rather than six.
**/target/
**/.build/

# Packaged Desktop runtime archives are reproducible release artifacts, and a
# bundled build stages both the payloads and the manifest that names them as
# app resources. None of that belongs in git — and the tracked
# desktop/runtime/lemma-local.json must stay the online-shaped placeholder, not
# whatever the last local `make desktop-dmg` produced.
/desktop/runtime/bundled/
/desktop/runtime/download/

# Local scratch output from screenshot/PDF tooling
/out/
/output/
/tmp/
.claude/launch.json

# CodeQL databases and SARIF output from `make codeql`.
.codeql/

# Local benchmark corpus for the datastore load tests (~310MB of arXiv PDFs).
# Reproducible via lemma-backend/load_tests/fetch_arxiv_corpus.py, which is the
# source of truth for which papers are in it — so the bytes never belong in git.
# They were committed by accident once and had to be purged from history.
# Both spellings: the trailing-slash form does not match a symlink, which is how
# the directory appears inside a git worktree.
benchmark-corpus/
benchmark-corpus
